Source: rugix-debian
Section: embedded
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Silitics GmbH <info@silitics.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://rugix.org/
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/rugix/rugix
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/rugix/rugix.git
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: rugix-ctrl-gnu
Architecture: any
Conflicts: rugix-ctrl-musl
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.63)
Description: Rugix system management tool (glibc build)
 Rugix is a suite of open-source tools for building reliable, secure,
 and over-the-air updatable embedded Linux devices. This package
 provides rugix-ctrl, the system management tool, linked against
 glibc.
 .
 This source package is metadata-only; see /usr/share/doc/rugix-ctrl-gnu
 and the upstream repository for the buildable source.

Package: rugix-ctrl-musl
Architecture: any
Conflicts: rugix-ctrl-gnu
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.63)
Description: Rugix system management tool (musl build)
 Rugix is a suite of open-source tools for building reliable, secure,
 and over-the-air updatable embedded Linux devices. This package
 provides rugix-ctrl, the system management tool, statically linked
 against musl libc.
 .
 This source package is metadata-only; see /usr/share/doc/rugix-ctrl-musl
 and the upstream repository for the buildable source.

